{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":15,"ref":"2-chronicles 35:15","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"de","chapter":35,"translation":"Und die Sänger, die Söhne Asafs, ⟨standen⟩ an ihrem Standort nach der Weisung Dawids und Asafs und Hemans und Jedutuns, des Sehers des Königs. Und die Torhüter an jedem Tor, Tor und Tor — sie hatten ⟨keine Möglichkeit⟩, von ihrem Dienst abzurücken, denn ihre Brüder, die Lewiim, bereiteten ihnen zu.","tokens":[{"surface":"והמשררים","gloss":"Und die Sänger"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"die Söhne"},{"surface":"אסף","gloss":"Asafs"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"an"},{"surface":"מעמדם","gloss":"ihrem Standort"},{"surface":"כמצות","gloss":"nach der Weisung"},{"surface":"דויד","gloss":"Dawids"},{"surface":"ואסף","gloss":"und Asafs"},{"surface":"והימן","gloss":"und Hemans"},{"surface":"וידתון","gloss":"und Jedutuns"},{"surface":"חוזה","gloss":"des Sehers"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"des Königs"},{"surface":"והשערים","gloss":"Und die Torhüter"},{"surface":"לשער","gloss":"an ⟨jedem⟩ Tor"},{"surface":"ושער","gloss":"Tor und Tor"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"nicht"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"ihnen"},{"surface":"לסור","gloss":"abzurücken"},{"surface":"מעל","gloss":"von"},{"surface":"עבדתם","gloss":"ihrem Dienst"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"denn"},{"surface":"אחיהם","gloss":"ihre Brüder"},{"surface":"הלוים","gloss":"die Lewiim"},{"surface":"הכינו","gloss":"bereiteten zu"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"ihnen"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T05:05:59.007827824Z","model":"glm-5.2"}